  "description": "Redis 운영 핵심 지표: 가용성, 연결 수, 메모리, keyspace 효율, 명령 처리량, eviction 및 blocked client.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Prometheus",
      "url": "/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22prometheus%22%7D",
      "type": "link",
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "mappings": [], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "min(redis_up{instance=~\"$instance\"})", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "title": "Redis Up",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 0 },
      "id": 2,
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "redis_connected_clients{instance=~\"$instance\"}", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "title": "Connected Clients",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "id": 3,
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "redis_memory_used_bytes{instance=~\"$instance\"}", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "title": "Memory Used",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "id": 4,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * redis_memory_used_bytes{instance=~\"$instance\"} / clamp_min(redis_memory_max_bytes{instance=~\"$instance\"}, 1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Memory Usage",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 5,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(redis_keyspace_hits_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(redis_keyspace_hits_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval])) + sum(rate(redis_keyspace_misses_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "hit ratio",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Keyspace Hit Ratio",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 6 },
      "id": 6,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(redis_commands_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (instance)",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Command Rate",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 7,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(redis_evicted_keys_total{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Evictions Rate",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 14 },
      "id": 8,
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "redis_blocked_clients{instance=~\"$instance\"}", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "title": "Blocked Clients",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 14 },
      "id": 9,
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(redis_db_keys{instance=~\"$instance\"}) by (instance)", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "title": "Key Count",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["redis", "prometheus", "exporter", "database"],
  "templating": {
